OL,3,ASerbian shot dead after attacking
OL,4,Aofficer outside Israeli embassy,
OL,5,Aminister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FSerbian police shot dead a young man
OL,8,Foutside the Israeli embassy in Belgrade
OL,9,Fin the early hours of Wednesday after
OL,10,Fwhat authorities called a "terrorist
OL,11,Fattack".
OL,13,FThe country's interior minister, Ivica
OL,14,FDacic, said the attacker had rushed at
OL,15,Fa police officer with two knives while
OL,16,Fshouting the phrase "Allahu Akbar". The
OL,17,Fofficer sustained a minor knife wound
OL,18,Fto the face and shot the attacker.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
