OL,3,ASerbian shot dead after attacking
OL,4,Aofficer outside Israeli embassy,
OL,5,Aminister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FDacic said the suspect has not been
OL,8,Fidentified, but he was a minor and
OL,9,FSerbian citizen who was being monitored
OL,10,Fby security services as he was "known
OL,11,Fto be a supporter of the Islamic
OL,12,FState".
OL,14,FSpeaking to reporters outside the
OL,15,Fembassy, Dacic said an investigation is
OL,16,Fongoing, but security services said the
OL,17,Fsuspect had posted a picture of the
OL,18,FIslamic State flag on his Instagram.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
